/><text class="label" x="44" y="82" text-anchor="start" font-family="Noto Sans JP, Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#111D1A">JSON Schema</text><text class="label small" x="44" y="104" text-anchor="start" font-family="Noto Sans JP, Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#111D1A">2020-12</text><rect class="box" x="240" y="56" width="190" height="62" fill="#F3F7F5" stroke="#0D5C55" stroke-width="1.5" rx="5"/><text class="label" x="254" y="82" text-anchor="start" font-family="Noto Sans JP, Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#111D1A">vocab-meta ・ dialect</text><text class="label small" x="254" y="104" text-anchor="start" font-family="Noto Sans JP, Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#111D1A">x- の9つの形と方言</text><rect class="box focus" x="470" y="50" width="300" height="82" fill="#D5E6E3" stroke="#0D5C55" stroke-width="2" rx="5"/><text class="label focus" x="484" y="76" text-anchor="start" font-family="Noto Sans JP, Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#0D5C55">Abstract の本体</text><text class="label small" x="484" y="98" text-anchor="start" font-family="Noto Sans JP, Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#111D1A">Concrete を作るための型</text><text class="label small" x="484" y="118" text-anchor="start" font-family="Noto Sans JP, Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#111D1A">欄 ・ rule ・ 任せる先の入力と答えの形</text><rect class="box" x="850" y="50" width="420" height="82" fill="#F3F7F5" stroke="#0D5C55" stroke-width="1.5" rx="5"/><text class="label" x="864" y="76" text-anchor="start" font-family="Noto Sans JP, Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#111D1A">基盤が用意するスキーマ</text><text class="label small" x="864" y="98" text-anchor="start" font-family="Noto Sans JP, Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#111D1A">glossary ・ change ・ judgment</text><text class="label small" x="864" y="118" text-a